			</cfif>
			<!---D55544 :: template settings:  allow distributors to be selected as group & ship to level on programs END--->
			,Specify_Operator_Groups <!--- D31561: Operator Groups Search --->
			<!---insert for groups if it's defined--->
			<cfif isDefined("form.Group_Deal")>
